/*
 * What an imported `.webp` is — issue #168.
 *
 * WHY THIS FILE EXISTS WHEN `next-env.d.ts` ALREADY SAYS THE SAME LINE: that
 * file is generated by `next dev` and `next build`, and it is gitignored for
 * exactly that reason. CI runs lint, format, typecheck and test BEFORE build,
 * so on a fresh checkout none of them has seen it: `import hero from
 * "@/images/hero_img.webp"` resolves to nothing, the value is `any`, and
 * `no-unsafe-assignment` fails the build on a line that is correct.
 *
 * It passed locally and failed in CI, which is the shape of every bug that
 * comes from a generated file being on one machine and not another.
 *
 * This one is checked in, so the declaration is there before anything runs.
 */
